  {
    "speaker": "雑貨店店主",
    "text": "ふふっ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "雑貨店店主",
    "text": "ここで『すみません』とか、おためごかしを\r\n言わないところも、僕は気に入っていたよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "bgm": "070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016005050050,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "店長……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600505/1016005050050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "雑貨店店主",
    "text": "でも、千雪さんが決めたことなら仕方がない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "雑貨店店主",
    "text": "……何より、あなたの人生だものね\r\n納得のいくように生きて欲しい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016005050060,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……はい\r\nありがとうございます……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600505/1016005050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "雑貨店店主",
    "text": "ん～、事務手続きは社労士さんから\r\nお話してもらうとして……何か他にあったかな……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016005050070,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……本当にお世話になりました",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600505/1016005050070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016005050080,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "店長に育てていただいたものごと、\r\nこの先も忘れません",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600505/1016005050080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "雑貨店店主",
    "text": "それは、光栄だね\r\nありがとう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "雑貨店店主",
    "text": "戻って来たくなったら\r\nいつでも連絡してくれていいからね？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
